deographer.strong_text.personality_fit.60814652":"性格契合","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.portfolio_quality.26039055":"投资组合质量","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.pressure_to_book_immediately.70967383":"立即预订的压力","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.professionalism.78395889":"专业精神","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.reviews.32080576":"评论","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.style_fit.91309124":"款式合身","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.unwillingness_to_meet_or_video_chat.55038449":"不愿意见面或视频聊天","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.vague_pricing.34906901":"定价模糊","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.value.72210817":"价值","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.your_budget.44199576":"您的预算","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.your_must_haves.95319525":"你的必备品","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.strong_text.your_style_preference.93382996":"您的风格偏好","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.title_text.how_to_choose_a_wedding_videographer_15.15714512":"如何选择婚礼摄像师：15 个问题","blog.choose-wedding-videographer.p_text.cameras_fail_cards_corrupt_batteries_die.98097275":"相机出故障。卡已损坏。电池.专业摄像师应携带备用相机机身、镜头、存储卡、电池和音频设备。一台相机和一张卡并不专业——这是一场赌博。"}